---
import ResearchLayout from "../../layouts/ResearchLayout.astro";
---
<ResearchLayout title="P4｜AI Platform Evolution｜J 的世界 Research" page="P4" section="AI PLATFORM EVOLUTION">
<div class="poster">
 <div class="poster-inner">
  <div class="poster-top"><div class="poster-kicker">P3 · AI PLATFORM EVOLUTION</div><div class="poster-title">平台，<br/>不是一次誕生。</div><div class="poster-sub">它是從晶片一路往系統演化的結果</div></div>
  <div class="poster-panel" style="position:relative;z-index:2"><div class="poster-kicker">THE EVOLUTION PATH</div><div class="flow-v"><div class="step"><b>AI / HPC</b><span>需求</span></div><div class="step"><b>Advanced Process</b><span>運算密度</span></div><div class="step"><b>Advanced Packaging</b><span>異質整合</span></div><div class="step"><b>Optical / Materials</b><span>傳輸與材料</span></div></div><div class="flow-v" style="margin-top:9px"><div class="step"><b>Thermal / Power</b><span>散熱與供電</span></div><div class="step"><b>Manufacturing</b><span>良率與量產</span></div><div class="step" style="background:#071a33;color:#fff"><b style="color:#fff">AI PLATFORM</b><span style="color:#d5aa55">系統化整合</span></div><div class="step"><b>Application</b><span>需求再驅動</span></div></div></div>
  <div class="poster-footer"><strong>PLATFORM EVOLUTION</strong><span>單點突破 → 系統整合 → 平台形成</span><span>P3</span></div>
 </div>
</div>
<div class="note"><strong>一眼看懂</strong>平台不是單一零件的升級，而是多條技術路線在同一時間往前走，最後形成新的系統能力。</div>
</ResearchLayout>
